{'symbol': 'VIAC', 'date': '2021-02-05 19:41:00', 'title': 'VIACOMCBS AND MTV ENTERTAINMENT GROUP SIGN YELLOWSTONE CO-CREATOR TAYLOR SHERIDAN TO EXCLUSIVE BLOCKBUSTER DEAL FOR MULTIPLE SERIES', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VIACOMCBS AND MTV ENTERTAINMENT GROUP ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THEY'VE PREEMPTIVELY EXTENDED THEIR RELATIONSHIP WITH OSCAR® AND GOLDEN GLOBE® NOMINEE TAYLOR SHERIDAN, CO-CREATOR OF YELLOWSTONE, CABLE'S #1 SHOW. SHERIDAN WILL CREATE EXCLUSIVE MULTI-PLATFORM CONTENT WITH MTV ENTERTAINMENT STUDIOS AND 101 STUDIOS UNDER THE MULTI-YEAR PACT WHICH INCLUDES FIVE CYCLES PER YEAR OF SCRIPTED AND PROCEDURAL SERIES. CONTENT WILL BE EXCLUSIVE TO VIACOMCBS INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO"}